==Description==
'''Kronus''' was one of the seven narrators that appeared in [[Blind Faith]] as part of the [[Null & Void Event]]. He was [[Kronus]], the first major boss and one of the [[Children of Exo]].

==Appearance==
'''Kronus''' was a figure shrouded in a red cloak, with cybernetic elements across its body, such as his mechanical left arm. '''Kronus''' also wore a grey mask, concealing his face, with what appeared to be bullets crossed along its body. '''Kronus''' had a neon-green hourglass on his back, as well as wielding a staff with a shard of the [[God Cube]].

